WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.670
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:33.890 --> 00:01:35.620
Currently, the Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:37.200
is in a tie.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:38.400
The last round \"Tofu Confrontation\"

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:41.620
has become a competition for
Shaoan and me to end the grudge.

00:01:42.740 --> 00:01:44.630
The review of the final began fast.

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.680
First, they tasted my Magical Panda Mapo.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.190
Its unimaginable design

00:01:49.520 --> 00:01:50.860
has amazed all the judges.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.090
Great!

00:01:55.200 --> 00:01:55.710
Good!

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:56.850
Hurrah!

00:01:57.130 --> 00:01:58.400
That's all you got?

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:00.330
I'll win.

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:02.820
Wait for my Tofu Trio.

00:02:07.170 --> 00:02:08.400
Shocking Verdict!

00:02:08.960 --> 00:02:10.310
In the Palm of Chef Pei

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:13.450
It's really a great trans-century magic trick.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:15.600
Mao's Magical Panda Mapo

00:02:15.750 --> 00:02:16.780
has immersed those gourmet judges

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:18.120
who have eaten various delicacies

00:02:18.140 --> 00:02:19.980
in surprise and pleasant completely.

00:02:20.480 --> 00:02:21.530
I can't believe it.

00:02:21.890 --> 00:02:23.680
He took advantage of the obstacle I placed

00:02:23.820 --> 00:02:25.110
to turn the tide.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:28.490
Panda Mapo is so special.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.270
But after all, he's just a kid.

00:02:30.370 --> 00:02:30.950
I believe the winner

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:32.070
of this competition will be Shaoan

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.460
who's a leading figure of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:02:33.640 --> 00:02:35.180
Yes!

00:02:36.780 --> 00:02:37.950
Laymen,

00:02:38.450 --> 00:02:40.290
you have no idea how great my teacher is.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:43.000
I believe there is a problem with your eyes!

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:43.970
Yes.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:44.900
Mao,

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:45.800
You're so great!

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:48.210
You're really a genius chef!

00:02:50.210 --> 00:02:52.820
We'll win! We'll win!

00:02:53.040 --> 00:02:55.130
But the competition hasn't ended.

00:02:55.310 --> 00:02:57.250
Next, judges will taste Shaoan's dish.

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:59.330
We're sure to win.

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:01.070
I can give you a guarantee of that.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:02.140
I hate that guy.

00:03:02.670 --> 00:03:05.470
When seeing such an amazing dish,

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:06.400
Shaoan

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.560
seems totally unmoved by it.

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.410
The fourth round of the Banquet Cuisine Competition.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:15.240
They have made eight dishes in total.

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:17.320
Now judges are going to taste the last dish.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.840
But it's behind the Panda Mapo

00:03:19.880 --> 00:03:22.040
which is a very impressive dish.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:24.510
It seems to be disadvantageous to you, Shaoan.

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:26.660
Don't worry.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.940
That kid just made the Mapo Tofu

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:31.400
which Chef Pai was especially good at.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:32.970
To put it bluntly,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:33.840
he's just a

00:03:33.890 --> 00:03:35.370
bird that cannot leave the nest.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:37.620
Judges,

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:38.930
please enjoy the vaster world

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.300
to the fullest in my dish.

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.280
It's the Braised Noodles with Tofu.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.540
After being fried,
the elasticity of the tofu is still so good.

00:03:51.390 --> 00:03:53.080
The noodles seem to be plump and smooth.

00:03:53.130 --> 00:03:54.940
I feel like the noodles can flick the seasoning away.

00:03:55.250 --> 00:03:57.020
Knife skills and cooking skills

00:03:57.150 --> 00:03:58.690
are all reflected in this dish.

00:03:58.770 --> 00:04:00.600
It has the incomparable aroma and the breathtaking beauty.

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:02.530
But anyway,

00:04:02.670 --> 00:04:04.820
I feel like it's just the normal fried noodles.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.660
But why does that guy

00:04:06.950 --> 00:04:08.980
seem very confident?

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:10.810
He's acting tough. He's acting tough.

00:04:10.860 --> 00:04:11.860
He can't make

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.920
a dish better than Mao's dish.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.970
Don't worry, Sanjie.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:28.640
How can someone like him

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.120
make an amazing dish?

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:37.570
Is this feeling...?

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:42.860
What are you doing?

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:44.170
Sorry. I'm sorry.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.470
Thank you.

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.180
What are you doing?

00:04:48.610 --> 00:04:49.300
You!

00:04:55.050 --> 00:04:56.860
Judges are vying with each other

00:04:56.950 --> 00:04:57.780
for the noodles.

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.800
They seem hypnotized by the dish.

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.800
Looks like it's great.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:05.880
Gosh! I also want to eat it!

00:05:06.300 --> 00:05:08.580
Yes. That's the scene.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:10.700
It's the evidence that can prove I've surpass Chef Pai.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.810
And it's also the power

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:13.900
of my Tofu Trio.

00:05:14.360 --> 00:05:16.100
Tofu Trio?

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:20.750
I heard it.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:23.750
I heard the melodies of three kinds of string instruments.

00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.760
The three melodies have combined harmoniously.

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.200
Play the soft, wonderful and indescribable

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:33.660
notes on my tongue.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.080
I feel like the snow is melting.

00:05:35.680 --> 00:05:37.270
Everything is united as one.

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.590
I feel like the dense fog is gone.

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.400
It disappeared in the depth of my throat quietly.

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.920
It spread from my mouth

00:05:44.970 --> 00:05:45.850
to my nostrils.

00:05:45.880 --> 00:05:48.070
The aroma of the land is coming from everywhere.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:51.400
I feel like it's caressing my throat.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:53.970
I saw it.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:06.900
I saw

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:09.070
the Land of Plenty which is covered in the fog.

00:06:09.120 --> 00:06:11.350
That's the fertile land of Sichuan.

00:06:39.210 --> 00:06:40.890
What on earth is that?

00:06:41.020 --> 00:06:42.270
Tofu Trio?

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:45.080
Are there three kinds of tofu of the ingredients?

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:46.260
No.

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.310
There must be something else.

00:06:50.130 --> 00:06:52.100
Trio.

00:06:52.760 --> 00:06:54.330
Tofu's trio.

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:58.630
Ingredients he used are tofu, noodles and meat.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.380
He only used them.

00:07:01.760 --> 00:07:02.330
Did he...

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.200
Chef Xie.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:16.630
Why are you sneaking around out there?

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.380
I sneaked some of

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.030
his tofu dish.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:22.760
You... You brat.

00:07:22.990 --> 00:07:24.660
But you're also curious, right?

00:07:29.770 --> 00:07:30.630
What do you think, Chef Xie?

00:07:32.160 --> 00:07:33.040
It tastes good

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.710
but it's just tofu.

00:07:35.740 --> 00:07:36.440
It's

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:44.250
not meat?

00:07:44.600 --> 00:07:45.250
It's tofu.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:46.850
Right.

00:07:47.430 --> 00:07:49.420
To be more precise, it's the remains of tofu.

00:07:49.670 --> 00:07:50.280
It's soy pulp.

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:51.730
You're right.

00:07:52.350 --> 00:07:54.060
To make it, he stir-fried the seasoned soy pulp,

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:55.290
mixed the soy pulp with the taro

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.120
and fried them.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.030
It really looks like the meat.

00:07:59.260 --> 00:08:00.200
He used very pure tender tofu

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.230
to make the tofu seasoning.

00:08:01.560 --> 00:08:04.030
And he used soy pulp to make meat.

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:05.740
So the third kind of tofu

00:08:06.280 --> 00:08:07.790
of the Tofu Trio is...

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.660
Yes, it's the noodle.

00:08:11.940 --> 00:08:13.910
The noodle is the third kind of tofu.

00:08:14.020 --> 00:08:15.890
What? The very delicious,

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.850
chewy and fragrant noodle is tofu?

00:08:19.210 --> 00:08:19.930
Yes.

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:21.990
I mixed tofu which

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.530
contains no water

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.140
with flour

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:26.960
and knead and flap the dough

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.500
to make the special tofu noodles.

00:08:28.980 --> 00:08:30.290
Seasoning tofu,

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:31.510
soy pulp meat

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:33.430
and tofu noodles.

00:08:34.190 --> 00:08:36.060
The three of them swelled to the three-dimensional space

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:38.090
and formed a texture which is like the stereo.

00:08:38.400 --> 00:08:40.270
So it is called Tofu Trio.

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:19.510
This is the truth of the Tofu Trio.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:22.600
He based this dish on tofu

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:23.460
and seasoned it with tofu.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:24.950
Basically, it only contains tofu.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:27.730
In other words, your dish

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:29.580
is a tofu dish which has cooked tofu with tofu

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.070
and given the essence of the ingredients full play.

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.690
A tofu dish which has given
the essence of the ingredients full play?

00:09:35.620 --> 00:09:38.060
I really admire your Tofu Trio,

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:38.920
Shaoan.

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:42.750
The exquisite texture of tofu,

00:09:42.830 --> 00:09:44.060
the crispness of meat

00:09:44.170 --> 00:09:45.420
and the great chewy texture of noodles.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.970
When the three textures pass through my throat,

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:50.110
I feel like the snow is melting.

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:52.790
When the stereoscopic flavor of the land

00:09:52.830 --> 00:09:54.780
merges with the three flavors,
I feel like I finally see the light.

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:56.670
That kind of pleasure

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:57.990
makes me feel like I'm in Sichuan.

00:09:58.380 --> 00:10:00.420
And that refreshing and pleasant light flavor.

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.610
This is the essence of the banquet cuisine of Sichuan.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.260
This is the first time I have eaten a tofu dish like that.

00:10:07.590 --> 00:10:08.690
It's a very creative

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:10.080
and unique dish.

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:18.310
Well, judges, please announce the result.

00:10:19.090 --> 00:10:20.550
I think we have to think about it

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:22.420
before drawing an conclusion.

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.970
I agree with you.

00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:25.110
Me, too.

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:25.870
Sorry,

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:27.420
please give us some time to think about it.

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.830
It's indeed the review of the last round.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.210
It seems that judges need to

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:33.120
make a prudent decision.

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:34.840
They'll discuss

00:10:34.970 --> 00:10:36.900
the final result in the room.

00:10:40.820 --> 00:10:41.410
Mao,

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:44.540
have you ever walked barefoot on the beach?

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.140
Like you,

00:10:47.230 --> 00:10:49.330
I was born in the mountains of Sichuan.

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:51.310
When I left Sichuan

00:10:51.510 --> 00:10:53.110
and saw the sea for the first time,

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:54.400
I did that.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:58.730
The touch of water surrounding my feet,

00:10:59.450 --> 00:11:01.220
the smell of the sea in my nostrils

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.490
and the sound of coming waves.

00:11:04.050 --> 00:11:05.540
Although they have different forms,

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:07.660
their natures are all about seawater.

00:11:10.860 --> 00:11:12.720
And only the seawater can bring you

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.440
the three special feelings.

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.560
Cooking is the same.

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:20.200
Only when the same ingredients turn into different forms

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:21.830
and merge into one again,

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.210
can you realize

00:11:23.420 --> 00:11:24.440
that the supreme

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.940
stereoscopic feeling really exists.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:41.990
I believe you'll lose

00:11:42.640 --> 00:11:43.870
this tofu dish competition.

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:46.690
So big.

00:11:47.830 --> 00:11:50.790
Why does Shaoan look so big?

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.650
Crap.

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:55.830
I think it's not good this time.

00:12:00.170 --> 00:12:01.970
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:02.370 --> 00:12:04.040
Crap.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:06.090
I think it's not good this time.

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:09.240
Silang, how can you say that?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:12.400
Before, I thought Mao will win.

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:13.850
I thought he'll definitely win.

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.250
But now, this is not good.

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:17.720
Are you kidding me?

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:19.060
This competition

00:12:19.120 --> 00:12:20.740
is closely related to my father's life.

00:12:21.270 --> 00:12:23.840
But even if the magic trick is very amazing,

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:26.570
what my teacher made is just the Mapo Tofu.

00:12:26.910 --> 00:12:28.810
However, Shaoan's Tofu Trio

00:12:28.860 --> 00:12:29.760
is an unprecedentedly,

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.450
incredible tofu dish.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:33.020
Idiot!

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:33.910
Mao will never

00:12:33.960 --> 00:12:35.270
lose to Shaoan like that.

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:36.650
Lei En, am I right?

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:40.290
No. I really can't affirm the winner.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:41.570
I think judges

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:42.660
are also racking their brains

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:43.850
to make a decision.

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.190
No way.

00:12:46.270 --> 00:12:47.350
Judges came out of the room!

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:49.710
Who do you think will win?

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:51.700
It's hard to say.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:59.110
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:01.010
The Banquet Cuisine Competition

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:02.450
has entered the last round.

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:05.220
The final result of the review
which determines the outcome of

00:13:05.270 --> 00:13:06.770
this competition will be announced now.

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:07.910
It's going to be announced soon!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:11.170
Shaoan will win.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:12.310
Shaoan is the winner.

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.630
Sister.

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:19.860
We must trust Mao, Silang.

00:13:30.940 --> 00:13:32.430
The four-round

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:34.810
Banquet Cuisine Competition has lasted
one day and one night.

00:13:35.140 --> 00:13:36.580
What a long-time competition!

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:41.080
You don't know the essence of the soup at all.

00:13:43.330 --> 00:13:45.490
So we tied in this round.

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:48.790
At this moment, I decide to leave here.

00:13:49.340 --> 00:13:51.530
Later, you killed Roger.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:52.780
Roger.

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:55.360
I can't believe that you're willing to
forgive someone like me.

00:13:56.650 --> 00:13:58.950
Mother, it's been a long time.

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.290
Until the third round, the competition was in a tie.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:03.290
So the result of the final round

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:04.870
will be decisive.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:07.330
Shan Lin's life,

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:09.770
the future ownership of

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:11.960
all the legendary cookware of Chinese Cooking Society

00:14:12.540 --> 00:14:13.170
and

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:15.580
the grudge between Shaoan and me.

00:14:16.090 --> 00:14:17.920
Today, we're finally going to draw a rest for all of them.

00:14:19.170 --> 00:14:21.810
Mother, it's been a very long time.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:31.260
The winner is

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:37.080
Super Chef Liu Maoxing!

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:44.320
Liu Maoxing won the last round!

00:14:44.930 --> 00:14:45.570
In other words,

00:14:45.680 --> 00:14:48.140
the final winner of the

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:50.680
Four-round Banquet Cuisine Competition of Loulin Palace

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:52.220
is Longzhen Restaurant Alliance!

00:14:52.590 --> 00:14:53.440
Yeah!

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:57.400
Great! Meili, Silang, Sanjie!

00:14:57.570 --> 00:14:58.320
Mao!

00:14:58.860 --> 00:14:59.900
Mao!

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:02.120
You're so amazing.

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:03.700
My teacher is so great.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.800
I knew you would win.

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:05.640
How dare you say that?

00:15:06.790 --> 00:15:07.480
Wonderful!

00:15:08.760 --> 00:15:10.620
Meili. Guys, thank you.

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:12.810
Great, Mao.

00:15:13.450 --> 00:15:13.960
Father.

00:15:16.530 --> 00:15:18.000
Father, we won!

00:15:18.650 --> 00:15:20.800
We succeeded to protect the Shanghai Cooking Society!

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:21.860
No way.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:23.280
Lord Zhang,

00:15:23.510 --> 00:15:25.410
why is the result like that?

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:28.570
The Tofu Trio which has been rated as the essence of

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:30.040
the banquet cuisine of Sichuan

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.820
is absolutely better than

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.300
the \"Tofu Juggling\" of that kid.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:36.040
How could Shaoan lose to such a kid?

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.030
Are you blind?

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:42.050
Right. What's wrong with you?

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.170
Shut up, everyone!

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:48.680
Please give me a

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:50.210
reason to convince myself,

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:51.210
Lord Zhang.

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:52.640
OK.

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:54.680
Tell him, guys.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.500
I support

00:15:58.890 --> 00:16:00.580
Shaoan's Tofu Trio.

00:16:01.330 --> 00:16:02.570
It has given the features of tofu full play.

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:03.740
Besides, its texture is stereoscopic.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:06.110
It's a masterpiece of the tofu dish.

00:16:06.640 --> 00:16:09.010
I choose Mao's Panda Tofu.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:10.660
The magical design

00:16:10.710 --> 00:16:11.820
and the wonderful texture

00:16:12.290 --> 00:16:14.220
bring an unprecedented breath of fresh air to me.

00:16:14.880 --> 00:16:15.980
I choose Mao, too.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.910
I didn't realize that eating can be so fun.

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:19.970
This is really the first time I have discovered that.

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:22.080
I thought about it for a long time.

00:16:22.260 --> 00:16:24.140
In the end, I chose Shaoan's dish.

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.330
There is no doubt that it's the best dish

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:29.300
with such extraordinary superb skills.

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:31.480
I'm willing to eat it at any price.

00:16:32.830 --> 00:16:33.600
That means

00:16:33.740 --> 00:16:36.320
the final decision-maker is you,

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:37.280
Lord Zhang.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:38.880
Right.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:40.620
Actually, both of your dishes

00:16:41.140 --> 00:16:42.310
are the best tofu dishes

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.160
which have pushed the envelope.

00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.070
Your dishes

00:16:46.120 --> 00:16:47.410
are neck and neck, honestly.

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:50.730
But the principles I always stick to are

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:53.310
(Originality)
originality and universality which is suitable

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:55.110
(Universality)
for Shanghai, the international metropolis.

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:58.080
Mao's dish

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.310
has already shown us a gorgeous, colorful,

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.160
crowed and unique idea before it was put on

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:03.540
the table and we began to eat it.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:05.370
We can eat while watching the magic.

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.770
That kind of cheerful and pleasant atmosphere

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:10.210
is like the sun shines on this great land.

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:12.240
Everyone who eats it

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:13.910
will feel very happy.

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:15.960
It's totally in accord with the spirit of universality.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.060
Wait a minute.

00:17:18.520 --> 00:17:19.970
After leaving Sichuan,

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:22.720
I've learned different kinds of cuisine all over China.

00:17:23.080 --> 00:17:23.560
And I've learned

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:24.640
cooking skills of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.490
You said my dish which has surpassed Sichuan cuisine...

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:29.390
No. My dish which has surpassed Chef Pai's limit

00:17:29.750 --> 00:17:32.290
lacks originality and universality.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.750
I really can't accept it!

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:35.630
No. Shaoan,

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.500
your dish has no originality!

00:17:39.760 --> 00:17:40.730
What do you mean?

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.700
I had eaten that kind of

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:45.780
dish you made today before.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.750
What do you mean?

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.680
It should be seven years ago.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:53.740
At that time, I was just an ingredient merchandiser.

00:17:53.860 --> 00:17:56.290
I had to travel to and from the basin of the Yangtze River.

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.900
One day, I went to Sichuan for business.

00:17:59.120 --> 00:17:59.810
I arrived at a restaurant

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:00.940
and ate that kind of dish.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:03.970
It's not meat.

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.850
And it's not noodles, either.

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:11.330
Until today, I still remember

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:14.020
that kind of refreshing, tender, smooth
and pleasant texture.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:17.580
Is that restaurant...?

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:18.060
Yes.

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:22.040
(Chrysanthemum Tower)
It's the state-owned restaurant, Chrysanthemum Tower.

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.510
That means, the Tofu Trio...

00:18:24.560 --> 00:18:25.080
Shaoan,

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:28.850
it's a dish created by your teacher.

00:18:32.740 --> 00:18:33.380
Shaoan,

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.140
you learned

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.100
the Tofu Trio from my mother.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:38.370
No kidding.

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.120
I didn’t learn it from anyone.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:41.520
I created the Tofu Trio.

00:18:41.570 --> 00:18:42.830
I can swear to God.

00:18:43.340 --> 00:18:44.290
After I left Chef Pai,

00:18:44.730 --> 00:18:47.330
I crossed the mountain and saw the sea.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:49.310
Then I thought of it.

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.630
It's my idea!

00:18:52.360 --> 00:18:55.180
It's mine.

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:57.420
It's so ironic, Shaoan.

00:18:58.100 --> 00:18:59.930
After you left your teacher and walked all around,

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:01.880
the new level you've reached in the end

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:02.960
is your teacher Pai's dish

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.270
which you didn't want to learn.

00:19:07.890 --> 00:19:08.350
Therefore,

00:19:08.400 --> 00:19:09.860
people should

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.760
return to their hometowns in the end.

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:16.030
Maybe Shanghai which is at the end of

00:19:16.860 --> 00:19:19.090
the 4-kilometer-long Yangtze River is your limitation.

00:19:19.990 --> 00:19:20.950
I'm too stupid.

00:19:21.150 --> 00:19:23.800
Can't I surpass Chef Pai?

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.600
I didn't expect that Chef Pai still have me

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.440
in the palm of her hand now.

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:44.930
Shaoan.

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.650
For Shanghai which is ready to welcome the whole world

00:19:49.690 --> 00:19:51.750
as an international metropolis,

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:54.350
traditions and formats

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.970
are not suitable anymore.

00:19:56.430 --> 00:19:57.420
It needs

00:19:57.810 --> 00:20:01.160
originality and universality which goes beyond

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:02.520
the common sense of the past.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.930
In Mao's dish,

00:20:05.040 --> 00:20:07.220
I've seen infinite possibilities of Shanghai

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:08.020
and the limitless future

00:20:08.420 --> 00:20:10.420
of Chinese cuisine.

00:20:10.950 --> 00:20:13.950
The four of us totally agree on that.

00:20:14.540 --> 00:20:16.840
So Mao is the winner.

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:20.330
In other words, Longzhen Alliance is the winner.

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:22.620
Yeah!

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.800
Great!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:29.140
You have my respect, kid.

00:20:29.260 --> 00:20:30.630
You're so great, kid!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:37.330
We worked hard to arrange all of this,

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:38.250
but that kid...

00:20:38.650 --> 00:20:40.110
Well, please give us

00:20:40.400 --> 00:20:42.480
the map and the code, as agreed.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:45.800
Do you know

00:20:46.070 --> 00:20:48.850
why I chose to compete with you

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:49.600
on a ship?

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:51.360
Does he want to...?

00:21:06.060 --> 00:21:07.550
What did you do, Shaoan?

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.250
Since we lost,

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.550
we can't just let you go back.

00:21:12.950 --> 00:21:13.510
What?

00:21:15.890 --> 00:21:16.450
It's sinking.

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.040
The ship is sinking!

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:23.500
The river mouth of the Yangtze River

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:24.960
is one hundred kilometers away.

00:21:25.280 --> 00:21:27.490
No one can survive here.

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:33.240
Let's die at the bottom of the sea together.

00:21:36.490 --> 00:21:37.470
Get out now!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:39.000
Mao, let's go!

00:23:14.976 --> 00:23:16.979
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.790 --> 00:23:19.840
Wow, the ship is sinking.

00:23:20.713 --> 00:23:22.551
The ship suddenly burst into flames,

00:23:22.676 --> 00:23:26.827
and now its huge form was about to
sink deep into the ocean.

00:23:27.423 --> 00:23:28.913
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.111 --> 00:23:30.484
The Yangtze River Burns!

00:23:30.484 --> 00:23:32.578
Shaoan Dies in the Ocean

00:23:32.578 --> 00:23:33.740
It will definitely be interesting!
